{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09290","headline":"端居感怀 · 韦应物","name":"端居感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈积素抱，婉婉属之子。\n永日独无言，忽惊振衣起。\n方如在帏室，复悟永终已。\n稚子伤恩绝，盛时若流水。\n暄凉同寡趣，朗晦俱无理。\n寂性常喻人，滞情今在己。\n空房欲云暮，巢燕亦来止。\n夏木遽成阴，绿苔谁复履。\n感至竟何方，幽独长如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}